  "definition": "The Scope of Practice of Licensed Acupuncturists",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-03-07",
  "historyNote": "#7081, eff 8-26-99; ss by #7872, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12 New. #10158, eff 6-27-12; ss by #13516-A, eff 3-7-23",
